{"content":[{"c":["JEDUTHUN"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Member of the Levitical family of Merar who, along with Asaph and Heman, presided over the music in the sanctuary in David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.25.1","r":"1Chr.25.1","rawR":"1Chr.25.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.25.1","value":"1Chr.25.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 25:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.5.12","r":"2Chr.5.12","rawR":"2Chr.5.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.5.12","value":"2Chr.5.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 5:12"},"; called “Ethan” in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.44","r":"1Chr.6.44","rawR":"1Chr.6.44","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.44","value":"1Chr.6.44"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:44"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.15.17","r":"1Chr.15.17","rawR":"1Chr.15.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.15.17","value":"1Chr.15.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"15:17"},"). Jeduthun is mentioned in the titles of ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.39.1-13","r":"Ps.39.1-13","rawR":"Ps.39.1-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.39.1-13","value":"Ps.39.1-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalms 39"},", ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.62.1-12","r":"Ps.62.1-12","rawR":"Ps.62.1-12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.62.1-12","value":"Ps.62.1-12"}],"t":"ref","v":"62"},", and ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.77.1-20","r":"Ps.77.1-20","rawR":"Ps.77.1-20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.77.1-20","value":"Ps.77.1-20"}],"t":"ref","v":"77"},". Some of his sons were set apart to prophesy with lyres, harps, and cymbals (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.25.1-3","r":"1Chr.25.1-3","rawR":"1Chr.25.1-3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.25.1-3","value":"1Chr.25.1-3"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 25:1-3"},"), apparently following the example of their father, who was called “the king’s seer” (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.35.15","r":"2Chr.35.15","rawR":"2Chr.35.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.35.15","value":"2Chr.35.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 35:15"},"). In ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.16.38","r":"1Chr.16.38","rawR":"1Chr.16.38","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.16.38","value":"1Chr.16.38"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 16:38"}," and ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.16.42","r":"1Chr.16.42","rawR":"1Chr.16.42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.16.42","value":"1Chr.16.42"}],"t":"ref","v":"42"},", he is listed as Obed-edom’s father."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jeduthun","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 25:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.25.1","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.25.1","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.25.1"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 5:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.5.12","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.5.12","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.5.12"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:44","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.44","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.44","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.44"},{"anchorText":"15:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.15.17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.15.17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.15.17"},{"anchorText":"Psalms 39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.39.1-13","rawQueryValue":"Ps.39.1-13","sourceRefExact":"Ps.39.1-13"},{"anchorText":"62","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.62.1-12","rawQueryValue":"Ps.62.1-12","sourceRefExact":"Ps.62.1-12"},{"anchorText":"77","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.77.1-20","rawQueryValue":"Ps.77.1-20","sourceRefExact":"Ps.77.1-20"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 25:1-3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.25.1-3","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.25.1-3","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.25.1-3"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 35:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.35.15","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.35.15","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.35.15"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 16:38","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.16.38","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.16.38","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.16.38"},{"anchorText":"42","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.16.42","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.16.42","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.16.42"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0d176780fa968fcc629c3cd5692f2cfce990776917a8016346ac27dafdf03bce","sourceItemName":"Jeduthun","sourceItemOrder":132,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jeduthun","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jeduthun","title":"Jeduthun","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}